      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just manually adjusted avatar height value. (in LocalAvatarData folder)\n\nWhen I type 250m in it instead of 0(default), avatar preview shows 250m as avatar height, but scaling dial shows 100.00m which should be 250m. I hope this finding helps dev team.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
